# Butler Routes - Westfall completionist pilot (pack butler-routes-completionist, v0.4.0).
# Every Westfall quest in the WoW Forever command center's tracker list
# (43 quests) appears exactly once as an accept and once as a turnin.
# Entry: the Elwynn guide ends at Sentinel Hill (turnin 109); this guide opens there.
# Humans and Skyborne share the route; race-locked lines are gated per quest data
# (6281 Human-only, 98021 Skyborne-only). Deadmines objectives are placed at the
# dungeon's Moonbrook front (166, 214) or Alba's south-road staging (92753, 92819).
# Coordinates on Westfall use the era frame; Stormwind and Redridge stops use live.
guide butler-routes-completionist/westfall
title Westfall - Completionist
levels 9-18
zone Westfall
faction Alliance
category Leveling
folder Completionist
keywords westfall, completionist, sentinel hill, deadmines, lighthouse
coords live
version 1

step Sentinel Hill — arrival

  tip Sentinel Hill, the Alliance hub of Westfall. Thor (56.6, 52.6) runs the gryphon roost; Innkeeper Heather (52.9, 53.7) binds your home here. Take every quest on the hill before you head out.
  accept 12 -- The People's Militia - Gryan Stoutmantle, first muster: Defias Trappers and Smugglers
  accept 65 -- The Defias Brotherhood - Gryan Stoutmantle; the trail leads to Wiley the Black in Lakeshire
  accept 102 -- Patrolling Westfall - Captain Danuvin, by Gryan's tower
  accept 6281 only Human -- Continue to Stormwind - Thor. Humans only: pick up A Swift Message (6181) from Quartermaster Lewis first, it leads to Thor and opens this flight.
  note Skyborne characters skip the flight chain: your road into Westfall is Journey to Sentinel Hill (98021), taken in Stormwind later.

step Alba Fairmoon's farm

  accept 92742 -- Testing the Wells - Alba Fairmoon, west of the hill by Scout Galiaan
  accept 92744 -- Murloc Gills - Alba Fairmoon
  accept 153 -- Red Leather Bandanas - Scout Galiaan, beside Alba's farm

step Saldean's Farm

  tip The Saldean farmstead, south down the road. Farmer Saldean (56.0, 31.2) and Salma Saldean (56.4, 30.5) hold the southern fields.
  accept 9 -- The Killing Fields - Farmer Saldean: twenty Harvest Watchers out west
  accept 22 -- Goretusk Liver Pie - Salma Saldean: eight goretusk livers

step Furlbrow's Farm

  tip The Furlbrow farmstead, southeast. Verna Furlbrow (59.9, 19.4) and Farmer Furlbrow (60.0, 19.4) work the last farm before the eastern road.
  accept 36 -- Westfall Stew - Verna Furlbrow; Salma Saldean gets the delivery
  accept 64 -- The Forgotten Heirloom - Farmer Furlbrow; his wardrobe stands far west at (49.3, 19.3)
  accept 151 -- Poor Old Blanchy - Verna Furlbrow; Handfuls of Oats come from the sacks out west
  note Furlbrow's Deed (184) starts from a Westfall Deed dropped by the Defias of the Jangolode Mine east and the Deadmines crews. Check your bags on the way.
  accept 184 -- Furlbrow's Deed - use the deed, then hand it to Farmer Furlbrow
  turnin 184
  complete 92742 @56.6,18.7 era -- the Jansen Stead water well, just west of the farm
  complete 153 @56.3,19.2 era -- the Defias Footpads along the eastern road

step Saldean's Farm — Westfall Stew handoff

  turnin 36 -- Westfall Stew - hand Verna's delivery to Salma Saldean
  accept 38 -- Westfall Stew - Salma Saldean; the shopping list: vulture meat, murloc eyes, goretusk snouts, okra

step Ozwin Ironsprocket

  tip Ozwin Ironsprocket (51.5, 32.3) tinkers east of the harvest fields. His harvester work comes in three same-named parts; the compiler tells them apart, this note is for you.
  accept 92909 -- Harvesting the Harvesters - Ozwin Ironsprocket, direct offer: Golem Isosprings and Harvester Gyrostabilizers
  note The two follow-ups share the name: 92910 starts from a Precessive Autocognition Assembly dropped by the harvest golems and ends back here, 92911 is Ozwin's Engineering follow-up. Engineers get their own gated steps; everyone does this one.

step The harvest fields — golem parts and oil

  complete 92909 @36.1,50.9 era -- the Harvest Watchers and golems: fourteen Golem Isosprings and five Harvester Gyrostabilizers
  note Bank the Flask of Oil that drops from the golems; Grayson at the lighthouse wants five (accepted later).
  complete 92742 @46.1,38.1 era -- the Molsen Farm water well

step Ozwin's post and Alba's farm — returns

  turnin 92909 -- Harvesting the Harvesters - back to Ozwin Ironsprocket
  turnin 92742 -- Testing the Wells - back to Alba Fairmoon

step Ozwin's post — Engineer's assembly
  when skill Engineering 1

  note Engineers only. The Precessive Autocognition Assembly (92910) drops from the harvest golems; Ozwin takes it and hands you part two (92911). Non-engineers skip this step cleanly.
  kill 36 optional -- a Harvest Golem, for the Assembly
  accept 92910 -- Harvesting the Harvesters - use the Precessive Autocognition Assembly
  turnin 92910 -- Harvesting the Harvesters - back to Ozwin Ironsprocket
  accept 92911 -- Harvesting the Harvesters - Ozwin's Engineering follow-up
  complete 92911 @36.1,50.9 era -- eight Golem Isosprings and four Copper Modulators off the golems and Defias
  note The Crude Scope comes from the coast murlocs and the Pillagers and Looters met later; it is picked up on those legs.

step The western fields — Militia muster

  complete 12 @31.0,33.5 era -- fifteen Defias Trappers
  complete 12 @41.1,41.8 era -- fifteen Defias Smugglers
  complete 102 @34.0,29.5 era -- eight Gnoll Paws off the Riverpaw Scouts
  complete 151 @31.4,34.0 era -- eight Handfuls of Oats from the sacks
  turnin 12 -- The People's Militia - first muster to Gryan Stoutmantle
  accept 13 -- The People's Militia - Gryan Stoutmantle, second muster: Pillagers and Looters

step Jangolode edge — Militia, part two

  complete 13 @29.0,50.0 era -- fifteen Defias Pillagers and fifteen Defias Looters
  complete 92744 @24.0,55.0 era -- seven Longshore Murloc Gills off the west-coast hunters and oracles
  turnin 92744 -- Murloc Gills - the gills to Alba Fairmoon
  turnin 13 -- The People's Militia - second muster to Gryan Stoutmantle
  accept 14 -- The People's Militia - Gryan Stoutmantle, third muster: the south road gangs
  note Engineers: the Pillagers and Looters also drop the Crude Scope for Harvesting the Harvesters (92911).

step The mines and Moonbrook

  accept 92745 -- The State of the Mines - Alba Fairmoon: kobolds and Riverpaw miners
  complete 92745 @44.8,21.0 era -- four Kobold Diggers
  complete 92745 @29.3,48.5 era -- six Riverpaw Miners
  turnin 92745 -- The State of the Mines - back to Alba Fairmoon
  accept 92747 -- Moonbrook Espionage - Alba Fairmoon: the crates around Moonbrook
  complete 92747 @42.0,69.0 era -- eight Suspicious Industrial Supplies from the crates around Moonbrook
  turnin 92747 -- Moonbrook Espionage - back to Alba Fairmoon
  accept 92748 -- Explosive Consultation - Alba Fairmoon sends you to Sprite Jumpsprocket in Stormwind

step Lakeshire — Wiley the Black

  zone map 1433
  tip The Defias trail leaves Westfall: east through Elwynn to Lakeshire, in Redridge. Wiley the Black waits there.
  turnin 65 -- The Defias Brotherhood - hand Gryan's message to Wiley the Black
  accept 132 -- The Defias Brotherhood - Wiley the Black; carry his reply to Gryan

step Sentinel Hill — the Defias chain

  zone map 1436
  turnin 132 -- The Defias Brotherhood - Wiley's reply to Gryan Stoutmantle
  accept 135 -- The Defias Brotherhood - Gryan Stoutmantle; Master Mathias Shaw in Stormwind takes it

step Stormwind — SI:7, the throne and the engineer

  zone map 1453
  tip One Stormwind trip covers the Defias chain, Alba's engineer and both racial handoffs. Sprite Jumpsprocket tinkers in the Dwarven District (61.9, 30.6); Master Mathias Shaw is at SI:7 (78.3, 70.7); Highlord Bolvar Fordragon holds the throne room (80.2, 38.4); Osric Strang runs the gryphon roost (77.2, 61.0).
  turnin 135 -- The Defias Brotherhood - Shaw takes Gryan's report
  accept 141 -- The Defias Brotherhood - Master Mathias Shaw; carry his orders to Gryan
  turnin 92748 -- Explosive Consultation - Alba's word to Sprite Jumpsprocket
  accept 92749 -- A Dynamite Plan - Sprite Jumpsprocket; ten Rough Dynamite
  accept 92750 -- Detonation at a Distance - Sprite Jumpsprocket to Jasper Fel in Old Town
  turnin 92750 -- Detonation at a Distance - Jasper Fel takes Sprite's plan
  accept 92751 -- Detonation at a Distance - Jasper Fel; carry his detonator back to Sprite
  turnin 92751 -- Detonation at a Distance - back to Sprite Jumpsprocket
  note Rough Dynamite (ten for A Dynamite Plan): the game data lists no Westfall source, so have ten in your bags before you turn in.
  turnin 92749 -- A Dynamite Plan - back to Sprite Jumpsprocket
  accept 92752 -- Explosive Consultation - Sprite Jumpsprocket; carry the findings to Alba Fairmoon
  accept 98021 only Skyborne -- Journey to Sentinel Hill - Highlord Bolvar Fordragon; Skyborne only, ends at Gryan back west
  turnin 6281 only Human -- Continue to Stormwind - Osric Strang takes Thor's message; Humans only

step Sentinel Hill — the chains return

  zone map 1436
  turnin 141 -- The Defias Brotherhood - Shaw's orders to Gryan Stoutmantle
  accept 142 -- The Defias Brotherhood - Gryan Stoutmantle; a Mysterious Message off the Defias Messenger on the Moonbrook road

step Alba Fairmoon's farm — the south road

  turnin 92752 -- Explosive Consultation - Sprite's findings to Alba Fairmoon
  accept 92753 -- Destruction in Deadmines - Alba Fairmoon; the staging moves to the south road
  turnin 153 -- Red Leather Bandanas - Scout Galiaan takes the fifteen bandanas

step The lighthouse — Captain Grayson

  tip Captain Grayson (30.0, 86.0) holds the lighthouse at the far southwest coast. Old Murk-Eye works the shore north of him.
  accept 103 -- Keeper of the Flame - Captain Grayson; five Flasks of Oil
  complete 103 @32.5,36.4 era -- five Flasks of Oil off the harvest golems, if the flasks have not dropped already
  accept 152 -- The Coast Isn't Clear - Captain Grayson; seven of each murloc kind along the coast
  accept 104 -- The Coastal Menace - Captain Grayson; the Scale of Old Murk-Eye
  complete 103 @32.5,36.4 era -- five Flasks of Oil off the harvest golems, if the flasks have not dropped already
  turnin 103 -- Keeper of the Flame - back to Captain Grayson
  complete 104 @29.3,76.0 era -- Old Murk-Eye, one Scale
  turnin 104 -- The Coastal Menace - back to Captain Grayson

step The western coast — teeth and gills

  complete 152 @42.0,11.0 era -- seven Murloc Coastrunners on the north shore
  complete 152 @25.0,49.5 era -- seven Murloc Warriors on the west shore
  complete 152 @26.0,73.0 era -- seven Murloc Tidehunters on the south shore
  complete 152 @24.0,60.0 era -- seven Murloc Oracles on the west shore
  turnin 152 -- The Coast Isn't Clear - back to Captain Grayson

step The western shore — Sanders' trail

  note Captain Sanders' Treasure Map drops from the coastal murlocs met on this leg. The trail runs Footlocker, Broken Barrel, Old Jug, Locked Chest; the map, the clicks and the turn-ins are all on this shore.
  accept 136 -- Captain Sanders' Hidden Treasure - use the Captain's Treasure Map
  turnin 136 -- Captain Sanders' Hidden Treasure - click the Captain's Footlocker (25.9, 47.8)
  accept 138 -- Captain Sanders' Hidden Treasure - the Footlocker points on
  turnin 138 -- Captain Sanders' Hidden Treasure - click the Broken Barrel (40.5, 47.8)
  accept 139 -- Captain Sanders' Hidden Treasure - the Barrel points on
  turnin 139 -- Captain Sanders' Hidden Treasure - click the Old Jug (40.6, 17.0)
  accept 140 -- Captain Sanders' Hidden Treasure - the Jug points on
  turnin 140 -- Captain Sanders' Hidden Treasure - click the Locked Chest (26.0, 16.9); it holds the Shirt, the Sash and the Booty Bag

step Moonbrook — messages and silk

  complete 142 @45.1,69.3 era -- a Mysterious Message off the Defias Messenger on the Moonbrook road
  turnin 142 -- The Defias Brotherhood - the message to Gryan Stoutmantle
  accept 155 -- The Defias Brotherhood - The Defias Traitor by Sentinel Hill (55.7, 47.5); escort him and learn where VanCleef hides
  complete 155 @55.7,47.5 era -- escort The Defias Traitor
  turnin 155 -- The Defias Brotherhood - the traitor's word to Gryan Stoutmantle
  accept 166 -- The Defias Brotherhood - Gryan Stoutmantle; Edwin VanCleef, inside the Deadmines
  complete 14 @36.5,76.5 era -- fifteen Defias Highwaymen, five Pathstalkers and five Knuckledusters on the south road
  accept 214 -- Red Silk Bandanas - Scout Riell, by Gryan's tower; ten silks off the Deadmines crews

step The Deadmines entrance

  tip The Deadmines open at Moonbrook. 166 and 214 go inside with your group; these goals mark the entrance at (42.0, 71.0).
  complete 166 @42.0,71.0 era -- the Head of VanCleef, inside the Deadmines
  note Edwin VanCleef waits at the bottom of the Deadmines; this goal marks the Moonbrook entrance, the group goes in together.
  complete 214 @42.0,71.0 era -- ten Red Silk Bandanas off the Deadmines crews, inside
  note The silk bandanas drop from the Deadmines crews inside; this goal marks the Moonbrook entrance.

step The south road — Alba's last stand

  tip Alba Fairmoon stages the south road at (38.7, 83.7) with the Detonator at (38.7, 83.6). 92753 goes inside the Deadmines with your group from this staging.
  complete 92753 @38.7,83.6 era -- place the explosives, inside the Deadmines
  note Destruction in Deadmines finishes inside the dungeon; this goal marks Alba's south-road staging by the Detonator.
  turnin 92753 -- Destruction in Deadmines - back to Alba Fairmoon at the staging
  accept 92819 -- Destruction in Deadmines - Alba Fairmoon at the staging
  interact 581792 @38.7,83.6 era -- the Detonator
  turnin 92819 -- Destruction in Deadmines - back to Alba Fairmoon

step Saldean's Farm — the shopping list

  complete 22 @35.4,36.6 era -- eight Goretusk Livers off the goretusks west of the farm
  turnin 22 -- Goretusk Liver Pie - the livers to Salma Saldean
  complete 9 @37.0,50.0 era -- twenty Harvest Watchers out west
  turnin 9 -- The Killing Fields - back to Farmer Saldean
  complete 38 @37.4,30.7 era -- three Stringy Vulture Meat off the young fleshrippers
  complete 38 @42.5,12.3 era -- three Murloc Eyes off the coastrunners
  complete 38 @35.4,36.6 era -- three Goretusk Snouts off the goretusks
  complete 38 @32.5,36.4 era -- three Okra off the harvest golems
  turnin 38 -- Westfall Stew - the full list to Salma Saldean

step Southern farms close-out

  complete 64 @49.3,19.3 era -- Furlbrow's Pocket Watch in his wardrobe
  turnin 64 -- The Forgotten Heirloom - the Pocket Watch to Farmer Furlbrow
  turnin 151 -- Poor Old Blanchy - the oats to Verna Furlbrow

step Ozwin's post — Engineer's turnin
  when skill Engineering 1

  turnin 92911 -- Harvesting the Harvesters - the last parts to Ozwin Ironsprocket; Engineers only

step Sentinel Hill — muster out

  tip Westfall done: every tracker quest accepted and handed in. The hill's flight and inn stand ready for the next zone.
  turnin 14 -- The People's Militia - third muster to Gryan Stoutmantle
  turnin 102 -- Patrolling Westfall - the paws to Captain Danuvin
  turnin 166 -- The Defias Brotherhood - the Head of VanCleef to Gryan Stoutmantle
  turnin 214 -- Red Silk Bandanas - the silks to Scout Riell
  turnin 98021 only Skyborne -- Journey to Sentinel Hill - the Skyborne road ends at Gryan Stoutmantle
